{"approval":{"approvalContext":"The authenticated user authorized one brand-new Seojin character_single_image planning unit to correct the v9 preview's proportion, surface-detail, and background divergence while closely following the reviewed style-only best-cut. This v10 supersedes v9 only for current visual, expression-profile, technical, and style-fidelity fields. It explicitly selects projectbs_character_open_ink_wash_dynamic_contour@2.0.0 with registered payload SHA-256 b0510a47827ba4b4d53f19220091799b6870b259ed23ef850dafde6444aeb6f5, binds the reviewed raster only as style_only, and forbids transfer of person, identity, pose, action, clothing, equipment, or edit-target semantics. The failed v9 preview is retrospective negative evidence only and is neither identity evidence nor an edit target. All historical decisions, handoffs, routing, prompts, previews, profiles, and records remain immutable.","approvedAt":"2026-08-17T10:19:01+09:00","authorityRole":"character_planning_owner","scope":"canonical_character_open_ink_wash_output_conformance_v10_and_current_character_single_image"},"characterId":"character.seojin.1","constraintRefs":[{"path":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v9.json","section":"immutable prior current visual/profile/technical decision v9; superseded for v10 current fields only"},{"path":"AgentDocs/planning-guides/common/DisignMasterConcept_rule.md","section":"디자인 원칙 및 금지 규칙"},{"path":"AgentDocs/planning-guides/character/data-structures/CharacterPlanningDataGuide.md","section":"Open ink-wash planning-owned projection and Generated Media Handoff Production"},{"path":"AgentDocs/planning-guides/content/generated-media/GeneratedMediaPlanningHandoffGuide.md","section":"Deterministic producer-owned planning capture and Closed Planning Snapshot v2"},{"path":"AgentDocs/planning-guides/content/generated-media/GeneratedMediaStyleReferenceBindingGuide.md","section":"Closed consumer binding and Planning and stage projection"},{"path":"AgentDocs/planning-data/style-reference-reviews/v1/character_single_image/open_ink_wash_dynamic_contour/gmstyleref1.character_single_image.open_ink_wash_dynamic_contour.d6dae45a8f8f6591b5cb.json","section":"/"},{"path":"AgentDocs/planning-guides/content/generated-media/GeneratedMediaAuthoringProfileRegistryGuide.md","section":"Character expression profiles"},{"path":"AgentDocs/planning-guides/content/generated-media/GeneratedMediaVisualPromptAuthoringGuide.md","section":"Open ink-wash output-conformance successor profile"}],"decisionId":"character_visual_design_decision.character.seojin.1.v10","decisionStatus":"approved","designFacts":{"seojin.appearance.body.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/body","value":{"description":"최우선 conformance fact는 전신 4.0–5.0 heads 범위와 목표 4.25 heads의 compact young-adult 실루엣이다. 머리 높이는 상투를 제외한 cranial mass 상단부터 턱 아래까지, 전신 높이는 cranial mass 상단부터 가장 낮은 weight-bearing sole까지 측정하고 fullBodyHeight/headHeight로 판정한다. 젊은 성인 팔다리는 압축·단순화하되 아동형이 아니며 자연주의 7-head 이상 장신, 6.5–8등신 또는 영웅적 해부를 금지한다."}},"seojin.appearance.costume.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/costume","value":{"description":"빛바랜 군졸복과 회갈색 여행 겉옷을 넓은 여백과 소수의 열린 먹선으로 단순화한다. 복식은 실루엣과 큰 층만 식별하고 garment microfold, 반복 봉제선, fastener 또는 조밀한 표면 정보를 열거하지 않는다."}},"seojin.appearance.equipment.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/equipment","value":[{"description":"한쪽 어깨 갑옷은 one broad dusty gray-brown pigment mass와 끊긴 identity edge 하나의 단순 shoulder form으로만 읽힌다. 개별 plate, scale, rivet, lacing, fastener, microtexture, 사실적 재질 또는 modeled lighting을 금지한다."},{"description":"작은 utility pouch 하나는 muted ochre의 작은 accent anchor로만 유지하고 small travel accessory는 dusty gray-brown 보조 anchor로 분리하되 표면 미세 디테일을 추가하지 않는다."}]},"seojin.appearance.face.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/face","value":{"description":"젊은 성인 한국 남성의 깨끗한 턱선, 곧은 눈썹과 차분한 시선을 소수의 high-signal 열린 mok-seon으로만 읽힌다. 사실적 얼굴 모델링, 피부 명암, 미세질감, 촘촘한 내부선 또는 아동형 둥근 얼굴을 금지한다."}},"seojin.appearance.gender_presentation.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/genderPresentation","value":{"description":"20대 중후반의 젊은 성인 한국 남성으로 명확히 읽히며 미성년·아동처럼 보이지 않는다. compact 4.25-head target 안에서 조선시대 군졸 출신 떠돌이 검사의 실용적이고 절제된 young-adult silhouette를 유지한다."}},"seojin.appearance.hair.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/hair","value":{"description":"검은 머리를 낮고 단정한 조선식 상투로 묶는다. 상투는 가변 압력의 열린 먹선과 넓은 미채색 여백으로 식별하며 불투명 검정 면, 균일한 닫힌 외곽 또는 사실적 모발 미세선을 금지한다."}},"seojin.appearance.handedness.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/handedness","value":"right"},"seojin.appearance.identifying_features.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/identifyingFeatures","value":["cranial-mass-to-chin/head-to-weight-bearing-sole로 측정되는 4.0–5.0 heads 범위의 목표 4.25-head 젊은 성인 비례","젊은 성인 한국 남성의 단순화된 얼굴과 차분한 시선","낮고 단정한 조선식 상투","한쪽 어깨의 one broad broken-edge dusty gray-brown armor mass","왼쪽 허리에 완전히 칼집에 든 조선식 환도와 손잡이에 얹은 오른손"]},"seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/intendedDisplay","value":{"assetType":"character_single_image","backgroundPolicy":"transparent","detailDensity":{"description":"Identity silhouette before surface detail. Target 4.25 heads inside the accepted 4.0–5.0 range; omit 35–55% of expected silhouette/internal boundaries targeting 45%; keep figure interior and full canvas each at least 70% achromatic or unpainted. Use only a few broad rough pigment masses and one broad broken-edge shoulder-armor mass. Prohibit realistic face modeling, plates, scales, rivets, lacing, fasteners, garment microfolds, microtexture, modeled lighting, and realistic material rendering.","level":"exact"},"framingPolicy":"centered full-body head-to-toe with generous clear space; no crop","outputUsage":"인게임 전투와 캐릭터 선택 화면에서 목표 4.25-head 젊은 성인 실루엣, 열린 먹선, 넓은 여백, 낮은 상투·단순한 한쪽 어깨 갑옷 mass·왼쪽 허리 환도를 읽는 단일 전신 이미지","providerCanvasPolicy":"profile_owned_technical_canvas","targetDisplaySize":{"consumerViewportOrReference":"인게임 전투 카메라와 캐릭터 선택 화면에서 전신 높이 96~144px로 표시되는 단일 캐릭터 이미지","minimumPixelSize":{"height":96,"width":64},"targetPixelSize":{"height":144,"width":96},"unit":"px"}}},"seojin.appearance.materials.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/materials","value":[{"appliesTo":"얼굴·상투·복식·한쪽 어깨 갑옷·오른손과 왼쪽 허리 환도의 열린 식별 경계","materialDescription":"open and broken pressure-variable tactile mok-seon with visible brush start, directional drag, dry end, directional weight, and broad negative space"},{"appliesTo":"승인된 faded blue-gray/indigo, dusty gray-brown, small muted-ochre palette anchors only","materialDescription":"few broad rough watercolor and pastel masses with bounded controlled bleed and misalignment beyond selected contour edges; no modeled light or realistic material rendering"}]},"seojin.appearance.palette.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/palette","value":[{"appliesTo":"군졸복 목깃·허리·띠와 칼집에 든 환도 손잡이의 제한된 primary cool broad marks","colorDescription":"faded blue-gray/indigo"},{"appliesTo":"여행 겉옷, one broad broken-edge shoulder-armor mass와 small travel accessory의 제한된 secondary earth broad marks","colorDescription":"dusty gray-brown"},{"appliesTo":"small utility pouch와 선택된 작은 수선 지점에만 쓰는 small warm accent","colorDescription":"muted ochre"}]},"seojin.appearance.pose_policy.single_image.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/posePolicy","value":{"description":"Natural front three-quarter full-body stance, neutral but ready to move, with the right hand resting lightly on the hilt of the fully sheathed hwando at the left waist; one viewpoint only. The style-only raster supplies no person, pose, action, clothing, or equipment semantics.","mode":"exact"}},"seojin.appearance.weapon.v10":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/weapon","value":{"description":"오른손잡이용 장식 없는 조선식 환도 한 자루를 왼쪽 허리에 완전히 칼집에 둔다. 오른손은 손잡이에 가볍게 얹고 칼집과 손잡이는 열린 가변압 먹선과 제한된 faded indigo 또는 dusty gray-brown anchor로 읽힌다. 사실적 금속, 장식 미세선, modeled lighting 또는 reference-person transfer를 금지한다.","present":true}},"seojin.single_image.expression_profile_key.v10":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/expressionProfileKey","value":"projectbs_character_open_ink_wash_dynamic_contour@2.0.0"},"seojin.single_